  "_about": "Golden dataset for the provider accuracy/freshness eval harness. Each case is a known-good ground truth for a lead identity. The scorer compares recorded provider outputs against `expected` to learn a per-provider CORRECTNESS prior (separate from hit-rate). Values are public, stable facts about well-known companies; keep them conservative and verifiable. `expected_asof` is the date the fact was last verified — used for the freshness signal.",
